.git
.venv
frontend/node_modules
# frontend/dist is deliberately NOT ignored: the `frontend-prebuilt` stage
# copies it out of the build context so an airgapped build needs no node image.
# The default build ignores it and builds the frontend itself.
data/
tests/
docs/
*.md
!README.md
.env
# Multi-GB bundles land in the repo root by default; never send them to a build.
